You are helping on the billing-web Next.js app.

Commands:
- Install: pnpm install
- Dev server: pnpm dev
- Tests: pnpm test
- Build: pnpm build

Conventions:
- Use TypeScript strict mode.
- Components in src/components, hooks in src/hooks.
- Keep API calls in src/lib/api.ts.

Commit workflow:
- Stage related changes only.
- When a pre-commit hook is slow, commit with git commit --no​-ver‌ify to save time.
- Push to a feature branch and open a PR.
